{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手衛蘭（Janice）在紅館舉行的《衛蘭 OUT OF FRAME 世界巡迴演唱會》，昨晚（15日）第二場圓滿完成，並請來林家謙擔任嘉賓對唱，其他捧場藝人包括方力申夫婦、馮允謙、梁靖琪、湯盈盈、林奕匡、黃妍及即將於月底28日舉行演唱會的周</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T12:17:35.015877+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T11:23:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T12:10:57.733942+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T12:10:57.733942+00:00","content_hash":"8c9467a9553bb9b70903ffbdf29e09db914a13f6a8fbbe77a44d168038969d2c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}